		<div class="content-body">
			<main>
				<a id="top"></a>
				<div id="siteNotice"></div>
				<div class="mw-indicators">
				</div>
				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Elites</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Elites" title="Slay the Spire 2:Elites">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div><div class="hatnote">See <a href="/wiki/Map_Locations" title="Map Locations">Map Locations</a> for all possible rooms.</div>
<p>Elites are highly powerful enemies that are found in <a href="/wiki/Map_Locations#Elites" title="Map Locations">Elite Encounters</a> which are marked separately from normal monster encounters. Defeating an elite will give you a random <a href="/wiki/Relic" class="mw-redirect" title="Relic">Relic</a>, 25-35 <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>, a <a href="/wiki/Card" class="mw-redirect" title="Card">Card</a> reward, and a <a href="/wiki/Score" title="Score">Score</a> bonus. The same elite can appear multiple times in an act, but cannot be encountered twice in a row. The <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dead Adventurer" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dead_Adventurer" title="Dead Adventurer"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dead_Adventurer" title="Dead Adventurer">Dead Adventurer</a></span> event ignores this.
</p>
<div id="toc" class="toc" role="navigation" aria-labelledby="mw-toc-heading"><input type="checkbox" role="button" id="toctogglecheckbox" class="toctogglecheckbox" style="display:none" /><div class="toctitle" lang="en" dir="ltr"><h2 id="mw-toc-heading">Contents</h2><span class="toctogglespan"><label class="toctogglelabel" for="toctogglecheckbox"></label></span></div>
<ul>
