<li class="toclevel-1 tocsection-7"><a href="#Act_4:_The_Ending"><span class="tocnumber">7</span> <span class="toctext">Act 4: The Ending</span></a></li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Ascension_Modifiers">Ascension Modifiers</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Elites?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Ascension Modifiers" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Elites?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Ascension Modifiers"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="1" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">1</span></sup></span>: Elites are around 60% more common on the map.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="3" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">3</span></sup></span>: Elites do more damage.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="8" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">8</span></sup></span>: Elites have more health as well as sometimes gain more <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="18" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">18</span></sup></span>: Elites have more challenging movesets and abilities.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Super_Elites">Super Elites</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Elites?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Super Elites" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Elites?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Super Elites"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>After unlocking <a href="/wiki/Acts#Act_4:_The_Ending" title="Acts">Act 4</a>, until the <a href="/wiki/Mechanics#Keys" title="Mechanics">Emerald Key</a> is obtained, one of the elites in each Act will appear as a burning elite icon. This elite will receive one of the following buffs and drop the <a href="/wiki/Mechanics#Keys" title="Mechanics">Emerald Key</a> when defeated.
</p>
<ul><li>[<i>Act Number + 1</i>] <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span></li>
<li>+25% Max HP</li>
<li>[<i>Act Number * 2 + 2</i>] <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Metallicize" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Metallicize" title="Metallicize"><img alt="Icon Metallicize.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Metallicize.png/22px-Icon_Metallicize.png?8d7d44" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Metallicize.png/33px-Icon_Metallicize.png?8d7d44 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Metallicize.png/44px-Icon_Metallicize.png?8d7d44 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Metallicize" title="Metallicize">Metallicize</a></span></li>
<li>[<i>Act Number * 2 + 1</i>] <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Regenerate" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One"><img alt="Icon Regen.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/22px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/33px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/44px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Regenerate</a></span></li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Relic_Interactions">Relic Interactions</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Elites?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Relic Interactions" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Elites?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Relic Interactions"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Black Star" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Black_Star" title="Black Star"><img alt="BlackStar.png" src="/images/thumb/BlackStar.png/24px-BlackStar.png?3767be" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlackStar.png/36px-BlackStar.png?3767be 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlackStar.png/48px-BlackStar.png?3767be 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Black_Star" title="Black Star">Black Star</a></span>: Elites will drop an extra relic</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sling of Courage" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sling_of_Courage" title="Sling of Courage"><img alt="Sling.png" src="/images/thumb/Sling.png/24px-Sling.png?8257f9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Sling.png/36px-Sling.png?8257f9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Sling.png/48px-Sling.png?8257f9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sling_of_Courage" title="Sling of Courage">Sling of Courage</a></span>: Start each Elite combat with 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span></li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Preserved Insect" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Preserved_Insect" title="Preserved Insect"><img alt="PreservedInsect.png" src="/images/thumb/PreservedInsect.png/24px-PreservedInsect.png?dccac3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PreservedInsect.png/36px-PreservedInsect.png?dccac3 1.5x, /images/thumb/PreservedInsect.png/48px-PreservedInsect.png?dccac3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Preserved_Insect" title="Preserved Insect">Preserved Insect</a></span>: All enemies in elite rooms will start combat with 25% less HP (and become visually smaller)</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slaver&#39;s Collar" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slaver%27s_Collar" title="Slaver&#39;s Collar"><img alt="SlaversCollar.png" src="/images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/24px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/36px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488 1.5x, /images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/48px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slaver%27s_Collar" title="Slaver&#39;s Collar">Slaver's Collar</a></span>: During Boss or Elite encounters, you gain an extra <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a> at the start of your turn</li></ul>
<p>With the exception of <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Black Star" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Black_Star" title="Black Star"><img alt="BlackStar.png" src="/images/thumb/BlackStar.png/24px-BlackStar.png?3767be" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlackStar.png/36px-BlackStar.png?3767be 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlackStar.png/48px-BlackStar.png?3767be 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Black_Star" title="Black Star">Black Star</a></span>, these relics also work in the <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dead Adventurer" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dead_Adventurer" title="Dead Adventurer"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dead_Adventurer" title="Dead Adventurer">Dead Adventurer</a></span> fight and the second fight of the <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="The Colosseum" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/The_Colosseum" title="The Colosseum"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/The_Colosseum" title="The Colosseum">The Colosseum</a></span>.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Act_1:_Exordium">Act 1: Exordium</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Elites?veaction=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Act 1: Exordium" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Elites?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Act 1: Exordium"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
