<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Act_2:_The_City">Act 2: The City</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Elites?veaction=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Act 2: The City" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Elites?action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Act 2: The City"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<div class="center-table">
<div class="elite">
<p><a href="/wiki/Book_of_Stabbing" title="Book of Stabbing"><img alt="BookOfStabbing.png" src="/images/BookOfStabbing.png?13c1ea" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="455" height="532" class="elite-img" data-file-width="455" data-file-height="532" /></a>
