<p><a href="/wiki/Taskmaster" title="Taskmaster"><img alt="Taskmaster.png" src="/images/Taskmaster.png?6493df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="314" height="381" class="elite-img" data-file-width="314" data-file-height="381" /></a>
